      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Prayer for my Uber driver, hes Muslim, I got to evangelize to him, he seemed very receptive, although I don't think he believes. I told him how and why Muslim beliefs diffentiate. I told him actually about how the Quran which says Jesus is a prophet and is true, also thereby proves Jesus is God because Jesus claimed to be God too. (I have watched lots of Muslim faith debunk videos 😉) he was quiet, but ultimately he didn't really say yes or no.\n\nI ultimately told him, to promise not to put 666 anywhere on his body",
      "ts": "2026-10-30T16:05:30Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 7236,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Prayer Request 10/31/2026:\n\nPlease pray for evangelism outreach during this evil day of human sacrifice.\n\nGod is our strength and we will overcome by the power, authority, and name of Jesus Christ ✝️",
      "ts": "2026-10-31T14:35:07Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 7238,
      "userId": 7369089799,
      "displayName": "Vanessa Arent",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Please pray for me and for my heart for any discouragement or tiredness or laziness, or even confusion or worry. pray for the people going out with evangelizing today for the trick or treaters, rebuke all witchcraft and evil spirits that may try to linger and attack us on this day.",
      "ts": "2026-10-31T19:57:22Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 7239,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Amen and Hallelujah to Jesus",
      "ts": "2026-10-31T20:12:15Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 7266,
      "userId": 7369089799,
      "displayName": "Vanessa Arent",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Jesus, our mighty Lord.\n\nThank you for this new day. Today is a new day which means we can choose to make it better than yesterday, we can choose to let the enemy win over our minds, or to keep him out, we get to choose YOU, Lord. Isn’t that something? Thank you for giving us the freedom to choose, and not be trapped in darkness.\n\nLord thank you that we get to live another day, we never know when the day will come that You come back, but thank You for allowing us another day, another opportunity to love the people around us and to spread the good news, thank You for Your enduring love, thank you for Sunday being a day dedicated to you. Thank you for rest, thank you for the Word of God we get to read and know Your truths about who You are and who we are in You. Thank you for trials that shape us into better people, thank you for the cross. \n\nMay we glorify you in everything we do and say, and think today, give us boldness and strength to keep going forward, guide our ways, and make Your will clear to us. \n\nI pray this in the mighty, matchless, most wonderful name of the Lord Jesus Christ. Amen",
      "ts": "2026-11-01T19:01:22Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 7267,
      "userId": 5309134293,
